            "review_text": "GARY C\nPrague1801 contributions\n0\nGreat Value Great location\nFeb 2017 • Family\nIn America I love the BK fish sandwich and they cost about $4. Here I get the same sandwich in quality and taste for $1. For a cheap inexpensive meal can't be beat. The staff was friendly but they had hip hop music blaring So loud I could not hear our conversation and I had to ask to have it turned down\nWritten February 5, 2017\nhcmtc19\nThank you so much, and see next time.\nWritten March 3, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
